# What a key is (U6d): what can be added at a place in a content file, each key with what it
# is, its default and its description, as the editor's "Add to" menu offers it.

# The Watch can still have its own rule tables, its expulsion and leaving costs, and secret members.
keys content/sample factions.toml city_watch

# A list takes items, and a file of entries takes new ids.
keys content/sample factions.toml city_watch.ranks
keys content/sample characters.toml
assert keys content/sample factions.toml city_watch.alignment == factions.toml › city_watch.alignment has every key it can
assert keys content/sample factions.toml nobody == error: nothing at nobody in factions.toml
